      "title": "Retirement projection range",
      "body": "Your projected balance at retirement ranges from $378,199 to $1,004,503 across the cautious and strong scenarios. These are planning estimates assuming real returns after fees of 1.96% to 5.96%, a 3.9% withdrawal rate, and a 15% flat tax on pre-tax accounts. Planning estimate, not a guarantee.",
